<title>UK: Allied Colloids H1 result -details.</title>
<headline>Allied Colloids H1 result -details.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30 (in million stg)  Operating result	 23.5		   vs 21.8</p>
<p>    Net taxed		  15.2		   vs 14.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Chemicals group Allied Colloids Plc earlier announced a 3.8 percent rise in first half pre-tax profit to 21.1 million stg. The figures in the above table follow clarification by the company of data in the original release.</p>
